    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31593" root="غر" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُرُورٌ</span></b>  <i>False,</i> or <i>vain, things; vanities:</i> (Zj, K:)
as though pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَرٌّ</span>, inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَرَّهُ</span>: (Zj:) or pl. of
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَارٌّ</span></b> ; (Zj, K;) like as <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شُهُودٌ</span> is pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَاهِدٌ</span>, and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُعُودٌ</span> of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَاعِدٌ</span>: (Zj:) or <i>what is false,</i> or <i>vain; a
deception; a thing by which one is deceived.</i> (AZ.)
See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَرُورٌ</span>.

